# A quote escaped with a backslash, inside a bracketed string array.
# GMANRIBTokenize::parseString decodes the escape; an undecoded "\"" would
# close the string early, leave the array without its "]" and desync the
# parse -- exactly the failure AGENTS.md's "RIB authoring" section,
# "The desync convention," is written to catch. A trailing Sphere follows
# that convention.
Display "string_escape.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 16 16 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [30]
WorldBegin
Attribute "user" "note" ["a \" b"]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
